{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00247",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.79,
      "end_seconds": 6.62,
      "duration_seconds": 5.83,
      "text": "Hi doctor, sorry, the lift was out and I had to take the stairs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.03,
      "end_seconds": 9.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "Yes, do sit. Tell me what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.27,
      "end_seconds": 17.0,
      "duration_seconds": 6.73,
      "text": "Mainly a ring-shaped itchy patch. There's a couple of other things, but that's the main one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.5,
      "end_seconds": 20.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "And when did that start?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.36,
      "end_seconds": 27.35,
      "duration_seconds": 5.99,
      "text": "It's been two months, I'm fairly sure. I took the morning off to come in today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.88,
      "end_seconds": 34.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.18,
      "end_seconds": 38.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "It's worse with sweating. It's moderate, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.32,
      "end_seconds": 42.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "What about darker skin around the patch, have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.54,
      "end_seconds": 49.99,
      "duration_seconds": 6.45,
      "text": "Yes, for three weeks. About darker skin around the patch, pretty moderate, if I'm being honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.58,
      "end_seconds": 54.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "Mm. Is it okay if I type while we talk?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.03,
      "end_seconds": 57.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Yes, of course, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.9,
      "end_seconds": 63.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any pain, fever or pus?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.14,
      "end_seconds": 66.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Oh, no. None of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.65,
      "end_seconds": 70.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "And similar rash on the scalp, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 71.98,
      "end_seconds": 74.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "No, no similar rash on the scalp."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.34,
      "end_seconds": 80.1,
      "duration_seconds": 4.76,
      "text": "Mm-hm. Is it all right if a trainee sits in later? No? Fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.13,
      "end_seconds": 84.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "I'd rather not, if you don't mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.91,
      "end_seconds": 87.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "Have you had any surgery before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.58,
      "end_seconds": 101.11,
      "duration_seconds": 12.53,
      "text": "So, you know, I had a bypass operation six years ago. I did try to ignore it for a while. I'm not great at remembering details, so bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.5,
      "end_seconds": 105.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "Sorry, the computer needs a moment to load this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 106.18,
      "end_seconds": 106.92,
      "duration_seconds": 0.74,
      "text": "No rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.44,
      "end_seconds": 124.64,
      "duration_seconds": 5.2,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Any medication at the moment, including things from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.74,
      "end_seconds": 135.94,
      "duration_seconds": 10.2,
      "text": "Glycomet, 500 milligrams, twice a day. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible. I've never really been one for hospitals."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.21,
      "end_seconds": 136.91,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Go on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.96,
      "end_seconds": 147.27,
      "duration_seconds": 9.31,
      "text": "Clopidogrel, 75 milligrams, once a day for the stent. It's the not knowing that gets to me. I take Candid cream, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.7,
      "end_seconds": 152.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "Do you need me to explain anything as we go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 153.67,
      "end_seconds": 159.18,
      "duration_seconds": 5.51,
      "text": "Just tell me in plain language, please. I'm not good with the medical terms."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.68,
      "end_seconds": 163.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Do you have any known allergies at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.36,
      "end_seconds": 166.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "Not that I know, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.17,
      "end_seconds": 179.99,
      "duration_seconds": 12.82,
      "text": "It's quite normal to feel unsure at this point. People often expect an instant answer, but a good assessment usually has a few stages, and today is mainly about narrowing things down and making a sensible plan together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.33,
      "end_seconds": 181.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.51,
      "text": "That's reassuring to hear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.36,
      "end_seconds": 185.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "Any long-term health problems I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.87,
      "end_seconds": 193.68,
      "duration_seconds": 6.81,
      "text": "I've had diabetes for about ten years now. My family kept telling me to get it checked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.26,
      "end_seconds": 196.21,
      "duration_seconds": 0.95,
      "text": "Okay. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 196.75,
      "end_seconds": 202.46,
      "duration_seconds": 5.71,
      "text": "I've had heart disease, yes. My sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.04,
      "end_seconds": 205.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Let me check your vitals now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.99,
      "end_seconds": 219.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "Hold still for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.39,
      "end_seconds": 238.27,
      "duration_seconds": 6.88,
      "text": "Okay: oxygen saturation is 98 percent, BP is 109 over 76. And temperature is 36.4 degrees, pulse 75."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 239.66,
      "end_seconds": 241.53,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "Is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.75,
      "end_seconds": 248.93,
      "duration_seconds": 6.18,
      "text": "We'll put it in context in a moment. Do you have everything you need to get home alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 250.3,
      "end_seconds": 263.99,
      "duration_seconds": 13.69,
      "text": "Well, um, yes, I've got my transport sorted. It's a bit of a trek, but I'm used to the journey by now, and I brought something to read for the wait."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.96,
      "end_seconds": 268.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Okay, let's do a quick examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 270.69,
      "end_seconds": 271.39,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.52,
      "end_seconds": 274.14,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "Bear with me a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.36,
      "end_seconds": 296.85,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "There's a red ring-shaped scaly patch with a clearer centre in the groin crease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.08,
      "end_seconds": 304.38,
      "duration_seconds": 5.3,
      "text": "All done, thank you, please sit down. Has anything about your daily routine changed lately?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 305.34,
      "end_seconds": 319.21,
      "duration_seconds": 13.87,
      "text": "Not really, the days are pretty much the same, work and home, and I've been trying to fit appointments in around my schedule, which isn't always easy, so I'm glad we could find a time today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 319.96,
      "end_seconds": 332.79,
      "duration_seconds": 12.83,
      "text": "Okay, so my impression is this: This looks most like a fungal skin infection. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. It could also be eczema, so we'll keep that open."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 333.33,
      "end_seconds": 336.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "Oh, is this going to go away?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 337.39,
      "end_seconds": 354.55,
      "duration_seconds": 17.16,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's a fungal skin infection, and we'll know more once the a skin scraping is back. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had a ring-shaped itchy patch for two months, moderate, and no fever or pus."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 357.43,
      "end_seconds": 358.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "Yes, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 359.51,
      "end_seconds": 379.42,
      "duration_seconds": 19.91,
      "text": "We should do a skin scraping for suspected fungal infection. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture. I'll start you on terbinafine cream, once a day, for two weeks. That should help with fungal infection. I'll put all of this in writing so you don't have to remember it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 379.89,
      "end_seconds": 382.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Right, alright, I'll pick it up today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 383.83,
      "end_seconds": 392.22,
      "duration_seconds": 8.39,
      "text": "Keep the area dry, wear loose cotton, and don't share towels. Please take the tablets with food so they don't upset your stomach."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 392.48,
      "end_seconds": 402.13,
      "duration_seconds": 9.65,
      "text": "Mm. I want you to come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse. Please come and see me in two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 403.6,
      "end_seconds": 404.3,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 404.82,
      "end_seconds": 410.68,
      "duration_seconds": 5.86,
      "text": "Tell me what you've taken from all that, so I can fill in any gaps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 411.66,
      "end_seconds": 418.8,
      "duration_seconds": 7.14,
      "text": "So, I take the terbinafine cream, once a day and come back in two weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 419.84,
      "end_seconds": 424.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. We're all set. Don't leave without asking if something's unclear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 425.15,
      "end_seconds": 427.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "No, you've explained it well. Thanks."
    }
  ]
}